WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.200
-I'm happy everyone's here.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.200
You know, today's Friday,
and that's usually when I

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.467
catch up on some personal stuff.

00:00:04.467 --> 00:00:06.501
You know, I check my inbox,
return some emails,

00:00:06.501 --> 00:00:08.300
and of course I send out
thank you notes.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.067
And I was...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:12.400
...running a bit --
I'm running a bit behind today,

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.767
so I thought if you guys
wouldn't mind,

00:00:13.767 --> 00:00:15.133
I would like to write out
my weekly

00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:16.467
thank you notes right now.
Is that cool with you guys?

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:18.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.067 --> 00:00:20.334
That's a good Friday crowd.

00:00:20.334 --> 00:00:22.601
James, can I get some thank you
note writing music, please?

00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:24.467
♪♪

00:00:24.467 --> 00:00:26.767
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.767 --> 00:00:28.601
He's kind of half smiling.
-Wow.

00:00:28.601 --> 00:00:31.367
♪♪

00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:33.968
-Thank you,
March Madness brackets,

00:00:33.968 --> 00:00:36.267
for being approximately
one hour of fun

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:39.033
followed by three weeks
of slow motion disappointment.

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:41.267
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:46.834 --> 00:00:49.601
Thank you,
daylight savings time,

00:00:49.601 --> 00:00:51.467
or as I like to call you,
microwave clock

00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:53.467
appreciation day.

00:00:53.467 --> 00:00:54.801
Yeah, we're back!

00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:57.133
-We're back.

00:00:57.133 --> 00:00:58.434
Whoo!

00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:07.133
-Thank you, giant Joro spiders
that can float in the air,

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:09.467
for still only being
the second most terrifying

00:01:09.467 --> 00:01:10.968
airborne experience.

00:01:10.968 --> 00:01:12.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:12.868 --> 00:01:13.934
-What?

00:01:13.934 --> 00:01:16.067
Come on.

00:01:16.067 --> 00:01:17.467
What?

00:01:17.467 --> 00:01:19.300
Come on.

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:22.501
What?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.501 --> 00:01:26.434
-Thank you, poster for the new
Pixar movie "Turning Red,"

00:01:26.434 --> 00:01:28.767
for looking like Bernie sanders
if he went on "Hot Ones."

00:01:28.767 --> 00:01:30.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:30.968 --> 00:01:33.767
-"Oh, it's the bomb!

00:01:33.767 --> 00:01:35.667
Don't give me the bomb!"

00:01:39.834 --> 00:01:42.801
-Thank you, White House,
for sending Kamala Harris

00:01:42.801 --> 00:01:45.934
to Poland and Romania this week,
or as she put it,

00:01:45.934 --> 00:01:48.834
"Sorry, did I not clap enough
at the State of the Union?"

00:01:48.834 --> 00:01:50.067
[ Applause ]

00:01:50.067 --> 00:01:51.701
Why am I...?

00:01:54.834 --> 00:01:56.334
-[ Chuckles ]

00:01:57.868 --> 00:02:01.400
-Thank you,
new Obi-Wan Kenobi trailer,

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:04.734
for not going by your original
name, "The Sandalorian."

00:02:04.734 --> 00:02:06.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:07.501
-Thinker.
That's a thinker.

00:02:07.501 --> 00:02:09.801
-That's a thinker.
It's worth it.

00:02:09.801 --> 00:02:11.334
-So worth it.

00:02:13.367 --> 00:02:15.968
-Thank you, premium gasoline,

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:18.200
for being Fiji water
for my car.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:19.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:19.634 --> 00:02:22.334
Wow.

00:02:22.334 --> 00:02:23.734
-Lot of money.
-Just for this?

00:02:23.734 --> 00:02:25.033
-Yeah.
-Okay.

00:02:25.033 --> 00:02:26.400
-Still cheaper that Fiji water.

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:28.067
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:29.534 --> 00:02:31.901
-Thank you, wallet phone case,

00:02:31.901 --> 00:02:33.901
for keeping
my credit cards safe,

00:02:33.901 --> 00:02:35.667
which is good to know
that if I lose my phone,

00:02:35.667 --> 00:02:37.734
I lose everything.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:37.734 --> 00:02:39.334
There you have it.
Those are my thank you notes.

